      "releaseNotes": "- Control Center toggle: pause or resume scanning without opening the app, it works with the Action Button too\n- Better widgets: a pause/resume button, a new medium size, and Lock Screen support\n- Register your own glasses: they move to Your Devices, stop triggering alerts, and show when they were last heard\n- Snooze alerts for 1 or 8 hours, right from the notification\n- The widget now settles to \"last sighting\" instead of staying red after a detection passes\n- Clearer paused state with one-tap resume, plus fixes and polish",
